{"version": 2, "width": 78, "height": 66, "timestamp": 1787863089, "idle_time_limit": 2.0, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/zsh", "TERM": null}}
[0.168788, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.526317, "o", "  ONE DEPOT, ONE NIGHT, THREE SETTLEMENTS\r\n"]
[0.65334, "o", "  depot-north — 18 vans on a congestion-constrained connection\r\n"]
[0.778725, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.135518, "o", "ACT 1  the meter reports\r\n"]
[2.041039, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[2.167566, "o", "  02:00: 22 kW   register 105500 Wh\r\n"]
[2.294332, "o", "  02:15: 22 kW   register 111000 Wh\r\n"]
[2.421141, "o", "  02:30: 22 kW   register 116500 Wh\r\n"]
[2.543557, "o", "  02:45: 22 kW   register 122000 Wh\r\n"]
[2.670518, "o", "  03:00: 22 kW   register 127500 Wh\r\n"]
[2.797288, "o", "  03:15: 15 kW   register 131250 Wh\r\n"]
[2.924039, "o", "  03:30: 15 kW   register 135000 Wh\r\n"]
[3.050852, "o", "  03:45: 15 kW   register 138750 Wh\r\n"]
[3.1772, "o", "\r\n"]
[3.53437, "o", "  every reading signed by the charge point's own key, verifiable\r\n"]
[3.660764, "o", "  offline by anyone holding the platform's public key\r\n"]
[3.785266, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.142072, "o", "ACT 2  the aggregator asks to curtail\r\n"]
[5.044001, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[5.171007, "o", "  03:14: curtail depot-north-cp-04 from 22 kW to 7 kW for 40 minutes\r\n"]
[5.294922, "o", "\r\n"]
[5.651744, "o", "  no capability: REFUSED — malformed capability token\r\n"]
[5.778558, "o", "  wrong issuer: REFUSED — capability token signature is not valid for this issuer\r\n"]
[5.903093, "o", "  the real capability: held for review — shed of 15000W is at or above the review threshold of 11000W\r\n"]
[6.029068, "o", "\r\n"]
[6.385925, "o", "  15 kW is within the 15 kW granted but past the 11 kW review threshold,\r\n"]
[6.511984, "o", "  and no operator is wired in — so the command is NOT dispatched.\r\n"]
[6.638865, "o", "  Nothing reached the charge point. The refusal is on the record.\r\n"]
[6.765564, "o", "\r\n"]
[7.119496, "o", "  re-presented, 7 kW shed: allowed\r\n"]
[7.246442, "o", "  03:14: SetChargingProfile dispatched, hung under the authority that permitted it\r\n"]
[7.371437, "o", "\r\n"]
[7.728229, "o", "ACT 3  morning — three settlements, one chain\r\n"]
[8.635206, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[8.762071, "o", "  energy bill: 38 kWh   EUR 10.64\r\n"]
[8.889069, "o", "  flexibility payment: 4 kWh   EUR 0.48\r\n"]
[9.015856, "o", "  baseline used: 22 kW, metered 15 kW\r\n"]
[9.142379, "o", "  method: nominated baseline  fingerprint e19ee448668d7b77\r\n"]
[9.267198, "o", "\r\n"]
[9.624159, "o", "  aggregator invoices: 10 kWh — the 15 kW shed it asked for at 03:14\r\n"]
[9.751065, "o", "  meter says: 4666 Wh — the 7 kW shed that was actually dispatched\r\n"]
[9.877723, "o", "  over-claim: 114%\r\n"]
[10.004663, "o", "\r\n"]
[10.361465, "o", "  the deep shed was HELD in Act 2, so it never reached the meter.\r\n"]
[10.488394, "o", "  The invoice does not know that. The measurement does — and the\r\n"]
[10.614511, "o", "  flexibility payment above is the measured figure, not the claimed one.\r\n"]
[10.738548, "o", "  The percentage is recorded, not enforced: a threshold belongs in a\r\n"]
[10.864595, "o", "  contract, not in a library.\r\n"]
[10.98855, "o", "\r\n"]
[11.344921, "o", "  both derive from the same signed readings. Walking up from either:\r\n"]
[11.471922, "o", "\r\n"]
[11.828743, "o", "    settlement.flex\r\n"]
[11.955141, "o", "    curtail.applied\r\n"]
[12.081286, "o", "    grid.allowed\r\n"]
[12.208303, "o", "    grid.intent\r\n"]
[12.331318, "o", "    curtail.command\r\n"]
[12.458352, "o", "    meter.reading\r\n"]
[12.580434, "o", "\r\n"]
[12.937138, "o", "ACT 4  somebody edits a meter value\r\n"]
[13.847129, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[13.973965, "o", "  edit: 03:15 register 131250 Wh -> 134750 Wh   (+3.5 kWh of flexibility, worth EUR 0.42)\r\n"]
[14.098858, "o", "\r\n"]
[14.455781, "o", "  result: signature check fails at 03:15 — that reading, and only that reading\r\n"]
[14.582508, "o", "\r\n"]
[14.939528, "o", "  the edit did not need to be guessed at. Every other reading still\r\n"]
[15.066398, "o", "  verifies, so the chain names the one that does not.\r\n"]
[15.193476, "o", "\r\n"]
[15.546977, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[15.673905, "o", "  Every settlement above walks back to a signed meter reading,\r\n"]
[15.799033, "o", "  through the capability that authorised the command that changed it.\r\n"]
[15.925622, "o", "  A command without that authority never reached the charge point.\r\n"]
[16.052304, "o", "\r\n"]
[16.408326, "o", "  The baseline remains a model. This makes the flexibility claim\r\n"]
[16.532064, "o", "  checkable and replayable by any party — not true.\r\n"]
[16.658939, "o", "\r\n"]
